# SSH
○	ssh admin@infra	infra is stopped: station machines start infra
●	In an editor	Remote SSH to infra
	No password: your key. Files travel through the same name; no folder of a Mac is shared.
# How it is reached
●	This Mac to mac-mini	over Tailscale · as jterrazz.agent
●	mac-mini to infra	its Mac's private network
# Inside
	Station opens it for debugging only; your tooling owns what runs inside.
